{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qO6bnf9rOv1794577739.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>政府推出沙田住宅地招標。</p><p></p><p>地皮位於大桶橋路與安心街交界。現時為油站及停車場，佔地逾8.6萬平方呎，可建樓面逾53.4萬平方呎，預計提供960伙。下周五起招標，12月18日截標。市場初步估值約25至29億元，每平方呎樓面地價相當於6,000至6,800元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:43:18.233512+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:36:47.728611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:36:19.659044+00:00","content_hash":"15720cbd0a5c1ef319c931716e6d71eee813d6169d87dcd57f78bcdaacedeb73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:43:18.233512+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}